1554
01:09:51.440 --> 01:09:54.300
There are two teams on opposing sides of a table.

1555
01:09:54.300 --> 01:10:00.480
You grab a quarter and you pass it underneath as slyly as possible, right?

1556
01:10:00.740 --> 01:10:06.140
